        <strong>Prof. Chairul Huda</strong>
        <span>Mahkamah Konstitusi · 2025</span>
        <a href="https://www.mkri.id/berita/ahli-pemohon-pasal-21-uu-tipikor-perlu-dirumuskan-ulang-23921" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Humas MKRI ↗</a>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
